5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of guessing who cleans up. Let’s make this official.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The noise from the office is getting worse. I need some quiet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must understand the cost of our choices before we choose.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I want to see the numbers! No more guessing games, please!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I feel like we’re drifting apart. Can we fix that?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, quiet is good, but who pays for the silence?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, I’m just stating a fact. The walls are thin.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, numbers are good, but they don’t tell the whole story.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, but they tell us if we’re broke! I’m curious!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, I agree. But we also need to talk to each other.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, talking is nice, but I want a rulebook.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
