17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, the physical space is a mirror of our habits.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, I’ll check the bins! They’re full of secrets!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I’ll check the fridge. It’s been there forever.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,I’ll look at the usage tally. Facts first.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
