35,2,1,talk,May,,The tally shows two people hogging the room. The bins are full of crumbs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The wall is thin. I can hear everything. The invoices are high.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,The facilities team came eleven times for the equipment. The lunch trip is twenty-five minutes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"I found the invoices! We paid 68,000 yen for nine bookings! And the awkward talk happened right here!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The fridge was cleared twice, but half the food was still there. We’re not talking.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, 68,000 yen? That’s a lot for a room we don’t even use.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, it’s for the outside hire. We could save that money.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, the money is gone, but the time is what matters.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, but the money is real! And the awkward talk is real too!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, I agree. The fridge thing shows we’re not cleaning up after each other.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,"@Kenji, exactly. The crumbs prove it. We need a system.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, a system is good. But the wall is the real problem.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, the wall is a symptom. The habits are the disease.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, I like that! But I still want to see the paper trail!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, I think we need a place to talk, not just a wall.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I propose we make it a formal meeting room.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. But we need to fix the sound.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,I support a clear purpose. Let’s vote on the options.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m in! As long as we sign the papers!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m in too. Let’s make it a place for us.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
